    - target: {fileID: 273281685853183525, guid: f2e2a0e9c1442b64a8a9c439534d7ac0,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: text
      value: "Dear challenger, before you stand a series of Logs. You must <b><color=red>
        step on them in the correct order </color></b>. First, there is <i><color=#606060>a
        metal button</color></i>\u2014 after stepping in the sequence, press it to
        check. If the order is correct, the <i><color=#563232>wooden door</color></i>
        will open.\n\nIf you find the puzzle too difficult, take some time to think
        by <i><color=#1ca3ec>the lake</color></i> on your right. But beware of the
        left side, for there are pillars of fire that may <i><color=#f27d0c>burn</color></i>
        you.\n\nOnce you complete the challenge, a star will rise from <i><color=#da6d42>the
        ground</color></i>.\n\nGood luck!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 273281685853183527, guid: f2e2a0e9c1442b64a8a9c439534d7ac0,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: PuzzleSign
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
