        Pilot your plane through
        dangerous crystal paths and floating ruins.


        Collect enough <color=#FFD966><b>coins</b></color>
        to clear the stage and complete your journey.


        Stay sharp, avoid
        <color=#FF6B6B><b>obstacles</b></color>, and keep flying forward.'
